<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BHC Financial raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BHC Financial raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said Wednesday that analyst Dick Bove had raised his rating on BHC Financial Inc to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- BHC shares rose 1/2 to 16-1/2 in late-morning trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
